{"id":"318303","name":"肉末花生米香菇酱","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"","cover":"images/318303/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肉末","amount":"150克"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"30克"},{"name":"花生米","amount":"100克"}],"sub":[{"name":"豆瓣酱","amount":"3大勺"},{"name":"辣椒酱","amount":"2大勺"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"2大勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：肉末、香菇（已泡发清洗）、花生米（已煮熟）","img":"images/318303/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将已泡发清洗好的香菇放在案板上切碎，待用。","img":"images/318303/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"烧锅倒油烧热，下入肉末，加适量的料酒。","img":"images/318303/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"翻炒翻炒。","img":"images/318303/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"接着，合入切好的香菇和已煮熟的花生米翻炒翻炒。","img":"images/318303/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"然后，加适量的清水。","img":"images/318303/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加3大勺豆瓣酱。","img":"images/318303/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加2大勺辣椒酱。","img":"images/318303/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加2大勺白糖。","img":"images/318303/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"调味翻炒翻炒，即成。","img":"images/318303/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}